     C*================================================================
     C* MVDBSC - Move data base fields to screen fields
     C*================================================================
     C     MVDBSC        BEGSR
     C*
     C                   CLEAR                   SCCHRG
     C                   CLEAR                   SCMRA
     C                   CLEAR                   SCNTWK
     C                   CLEAR                   SCOTHR
     C                   CLEAR                   SCOTH2
     C                   CLEAR                   SCPAID
     C                   CLEAR                   SCDIA1
     C                   CLEAR                   SCDIA2
     C                   CLEAR                   SCDIA3
     C                   CLEAR                   SCDIA4
     C                   CLEAR                   SCD1DS
     C                   CLEAR                   SCD2DS
     C                   CLEAR                   SCD3DS
     C                   CLEAR                   SCD4DS
     C                   CLEAR                   SCSVZP
     C*** Beg Add *** 07/18/25 ***************************************
     C                   CLEAR                   SCZIP
     C                   CLEAR                   SCSNPI
     C*** End Add *** 07/18/25 ***************************************
     C*
     C* If in ADD mode and @@RRN is not zero, then user has used F12
     C* from the detail program.  This require a chain to the
     C* Header Info file in order to access the Header information.
     C*
     C     @@MODE        IFEQ      'A'
     C     @@RRN         ANDNE     *ZEROS
     C     @@RRN         CHAIN(N)  DBRCDF                             99
     C                   ENDIF                                                  @@MODE = 'A'
     C*
     C** GET PROVIDER SPECIALTY CODE (SERVICING PROVIDER)
     C*
     C                   MOVE      EOFEIN        KKFEIN
     C                   MOVE      EOMOD         KKMOD
     C*  IF THERE IS A SPECIALTY CODE IN THE FAEOP FILE, USE IT;
     C*    OTHERWISE, USE THE ON IN FMPDP
     C     EOSPCD        IFNE      *BLANKS
     C                   MOVEL     EOSPCD        SCSPCD
     C                   ELSE
     C     PDKY          CHAIN     PPD01                              99
     C  N99              MOVEL     PDSPCD        SCSPCD
     C                   ENDIF
     C*
     C* Load service zip code
     C*
     C     EDITST        IFNE      'PA'
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SCSVZP
     C*
     C     EOFLIC        IFNE      *BLANKS
     C                   MOVEL     EOFLIC        SCSVZP
     C*** Beg Add *** 07/18/25 ***************************************
     C                   MOVE      EOFLIC        SCZIP
     C*** End Add *** 07/18/25 ***************************************
     C                   ELSE
     C     P1KY          CHAIN     PP101                              99
     C  N99              MOVEL     P1ZIP         SCSVZP
     C*** Beg Add *** 07/18/25 ***************************************
     C  N99              MOVE      P1ZIP         SCZIP
     C*** End Add *** 07/18/25 ***************************************
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN99=OFF
     C*
     C                   ELSE
     C                   MOVEL     EOFLIC        SCSVZP
     C*** Beg Add *** 07/18/25 ***************************************
     C                   MOVE      EOFLIC        SCZIP
     C*** End Add *** 07/18/25 ***************************************
     C*
     C                   ENDIF                                                  SCAST<>PA
     C*
     C                   MOVEL     SCSPCD        ##KEY
     C     SPKY          CHAIN     PSP01                              99
     C  N99              MOVEL     SPDESC        SCSCDS
     C*
     C                   MOVEL     EOAST         SCAST
     C                   MOVE(P)   EOZIPA        SCZIPA
     C*
     C* DETERMINE IF ANY EOB/NOTES EXISTS FOR THIS BILL
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     EOSUB#        KKSUB#
     C                   Z-ADD     EOFND         KKFND
     C                   Z-ADD     EOFYR         KKFYR
     C                   Z-ADD     EOCASE        KKCASE
     C                   Z-ADD     EOEOB#        KKEOB#
     C     EEKY          CHAIN     PEE01                              99
     C     *IN99         IFEQ      *OFF
     C                   SETON                                        68
     C                   ELSE
     C                   SETOFF                                       68
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN99 IFEQ *OFF
     C                   MOVEL     'D'           KKLOST
     C*** Beg Add *** 07/18/25 ***************************************
     C                   MOVEL     EDTNPI        SCSNPI
     C*** End Add *** 07/18/25 ***************************************
     C*** Beg Chg *** 05/23/13 ****************************************
     C********           MOVE(P)   EDDIA1        SCDIA1
     C                   MOVEL(P)  EDDIA1        SCDIA1
     C*** End Chg *** 05/23/13 ****************************************
     C                   MOVEL(P)  EDFLIC        SCFLIC
     C*** Beg Chg *** 05/23/13 ****************************************
